  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the chopped bell pepper and cook until tender",
    "Add the pre-fried teque nos to the skillet and stir to combine",
    "Fold the teque nos in half to form empanadas",
    "Cook the empanadas for 2-3 minutes on each side, until crispy and golden brown",
    "Season with salt, black pepper, and ayurvedic spice blend",
    "Serve hot and enjoy"
